cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software if you use circyto, and record the exact version
  and Git commit. The paper 'circyto for integrated single-cell circRNA analysis in
  radiation research' was submitted to CMPB on 2026-11-20 and is not
  yet a published citation. Cite upstream detectors separately; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
type: software
title: "circyto: single-cell circular RNA evidence integration and multimodal export"
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Yu-Chen
version: 0.10.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/liuifrec/circyto"
url: "https://github.com/liuifrec/circyto"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Python CLI toolkit for single-cell circRNA detector orchestration,
  matrix generation, annotation, quality control, and AnnData/MuData export.
